		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/喧闹兽众%B7瓦尔瓦拉.assets/Image_3.png')" x="64" y="64" blendMode="normal">
		</BitmapImage>
		<RichText x="738" y="703" width="424" height="143" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">长耳进行蓄力，在冰刀上凝聚风元素，随后自转并朝玩家方向移动，进行旋转攻击，造成<span color="#7fffd7">50%,25%,5%</span><span>伤害。受</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响后，将在原地高速旋转，随后崩飞。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="959" width="439" height="200" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">进行「情谊佑助」时，负责产生<span color="#bfffdf">排斥风场</span><span>，每</span><span color="#ffdfbf">3s</span><span>一次，若受</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响则无法产生风场。低于</span><span color="#ffdfbf">50%</span><span>生命值时，其余2位兽众将加入战斗并保护长耳，渠联在周围持续召唤下落水果攻击，狮獒为其展开</span><span textDecoration="underline">支援护罩·柔</span><span>。受保护时生命值不会低于</span><span color="#ffdfbf">25%</span><span>。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/喧闹兽众%B7瓦尔瓦拉.assets/Image_4.png')" x="719" y="618">
		</BitmapImage>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/喧闹兽众%B7瓦尔瓦拉.assets/Image_5.png')" x="720" y="874">
		</BitmapImage>
		<RichText x="739" y="255" width="397" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">长耳将手中的银斧丢出，造成<span color="#b8b8b8">75%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="479" width="439" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">长耳利利用冰刀进行扫、劈至多2段的攻击，分别造成<span color="#b8b8b8">55%,100%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
